BLOCK STRIKE

This project is a fan-made browser game inspired by Counter-Strike 1.6.

Player models (CT/T) are converted from classic Counter-Strike assets.
Map pack "as_cs_es_kvartal" files included as reference / overview only.

No commercial use of third-party assets without proper rights.
Code (JS/CSS/HTML structure) may be used and modified freely for non-commercial projects.
